<title>USA: St. Louis $61.7 mln deal repriced, yields raised.</title>
<headline>St. Louis $61.7 mln deal repriced, yields raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Inc said Wednesday it repriced Regional Convention and Sports Complex Authority, Mo.'s $61.7 million bond deal, raising yields in most maturities and lifting the top yield in 2021 to 5.68 percent from 5.60 percent.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
